  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Materials used include cardboard, gauze, wire, and papers of various weights and textures. The front cover illustration has a frame made with powder from a ruined clinic building in Matanzas.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">The illustrations are reproductions of black and white engravings of buildings and views of Matanzas.</subfield>
  </datafield>
